  "id": "USN-8938-1",
  "summary": "cifs-utils vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that cifs-utils incorrectly handled credentials files\nused by privileged mount.cifs invocations. A local attacker could\npossibly use this issue to inject arbitrary mount options into a\nprivileged mount, resulting in a privilege escalation.",
